WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.990
Draw y equals one over x, for positive x.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:08.510
Shade underneath from one to
two: a narrow, tall region.

3
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:13.150
Now from two to four: twice as
wide, but the curve is lower.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.350
Which region has more area?

5
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.430
Is the wider one twice as big?

6
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:18.740
Half as big?

7
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:23.440
In this mission, you'll find that
integrating one over x gives a logarithm.

8
00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.650
And you'll use a definite
integral to find an area:

9
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.180
F of b minus F of a.

10
00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:34.070
Your mission: work out whether the area
from two to four is bigger than the area

11
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.400
from one to two.
